<title>OMAN: Oman's Sultan Qaboos postpones trip to India.</title>
<headline>Oman's Sultan Qaboos postpones trip to India.</headline>
<dateline>MUSCAT 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oman's Sultan Qaboos postponed an official visit to India because of bad weather, a statement from the royal court said on Monday.</p>
<p>A new date for the visit, which was supposed to start on Tuesday, would be agreed within the next few days, it added.</p>
</text>
